      "message": "Hi Bart,\nIs this intentional to call `ufshcd_mcq_sqe_search()` even when QUIRK is set? AFAICT, we don\u0027t proceed in this function regardless of the return value of `ufshcd_mcq_sqe_search()`, so is the call required? Or shall it behave more like `UFSHCD_QUIRK_MCQ_BROKEN_RTC` and return -ETIMEDOUT immediately?",
