      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, the `ufshcd_mcq_sqe_search()` call is intentional. As one can see in the `ufshcd_clear_cmd()` callers, e.g. `ufshcd_eh_device_reset_handler()` and `ufshcd_try_to_abort_task()`, `ufshcd_mcq_sq_cleanup()` must only return 0 if a command has been cleared successfully. I will send a patch upstream that fixes the other code paths in `ufshcd_mcq_sq_cleanup()`.",
